            <itemList xml:id="itemList_45fb6b15">
               <item label="" xml:id="item_a94bb3c9">
                  <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_2f0ba26a">
                     <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_4cacba7f">Paper of fairly good quality; pages trimmed. Half-bound with and red marbled boards and light-brown spine and corners; on spine in golden letters 'VON | BÖSEN | WEIBER'. Not in the best condition. 'Ein Weib so tugendhaft darf sich hierum nicht &amp;lt;grämen&amp;gt; | Die lasterhafter kan der tugend nichts benehmen.' added in ink on paste-down. A previous owner has added his or her signature in brown ink on title page. Source contains pencil markings and is bound with a copy of SchW C3:002.</physMedium>
                  </physDesc>
